.TH CHTTPCLIENT_ASYNC_RESULT_FREE 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Functions"
.SH NAME
chttpclient_async_result_free \- release a chttpcli_async_result_t
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <chttpclient.h>

void chttpclient_async_result_free(chttpcli_async_result_t *result);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Releases a chttpcli_async_result_t obtained via
chttpclient_async_result_get.  Does NOT free result->resp; free
that separately with chttpclient_resp_free first if
result->rv == ccol_success.  Does NOT free the future itself; pair
with exactly one ctpool_future_free, called separately (before or
after this call, order does not matter).
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
result Result to free; NULL is a safe no-op.
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
None.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR chttpclient_async_result_get (3),
.BR chttpclient_resp_free (3),
.BR ctpool_future_free (3)
